  "body": "Consider this example:\r\nA web app used a bluetooth peripheral device when ever visited. With the current API the user will have to interact and select the device every time the web app is visited. This is a usability hassle as the user will have to open the paring menu and select the device every time the site is visited.\r\n\r\nIt is possible to include a feature such that devices already known can be used without having to select them from the paring dropdown?",
